        "created_at": "2015-01-12T15:22:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That also ruins my plan, which was end of days and all 3 forced deployments + golems and constructs and environment targets.</p><p>Dynamic Syphon on Omnitron-X and others with similar powers let Forced deployment activate more than just 3 times.</p><p>I gave up when I realized imbued Vitality could add even more.</p>",
