      {
        "id": 126908,
        "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-12T17:05:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The original idea was just to see how many targets you could get out at once. &nbsp;Then I decided to up the ante by seeing how many targets you could get out and then destroy. &nbsp;I unfortunately didn't think through the implications of that version... &nbsp;and I completely forgot about Imbued Vitality.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>With strange loops and talking hair dryers out of the way, the puzzle should be more managable (although the easy infinite solution is gone) while still being interesting, I hope.</p>",
